  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 12-layer HfO2/SiO2 multilayer stack on silicon substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: alternating HfO2/SiO2 starting with HfO2 (6 pairs, 12 finite layers). Initialize all layer thicknesses uniformly distributed between 250-550 nm. Use localized perturbation optimizer with reduced step size (learning rate 0.01-0.05) for fine-scale thickness tuning. Target: maximize absorptance/emissivity in 8000-13000 nm band, minimize emissivity in 3000-5000 nm band. Normal incidence, unpolarized or average of TE/TM. Evaluate candidates via TMM. Do not reproduce thickness arrays matching excluded fingerprints: 5730cdc3d0a12ddf, d672da543a029796, 5dcb880065e6b552, 6f233010bd58d5ec, 3e3543b14e3f2172, d69f71359c410182, 5df8a77d62a82442, 90d74c952ccb7c62. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 3000-5000 nm, 8000-13000 nm. soft objectives: high emissivity in 8000-13000 nm; low emissivity in 3000-5000 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: high emissivity in 3000-5000 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count not exceeding 24.",
